[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0229","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0229.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0561","title":"Drummond Miles A1Stats 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Drummond Miles A1Stats 1.0 及更早版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 a1disp2.cgi、a1disp3.cgi 或 a1disp4.cgi 脚本发送包含 '..'（点点）序列的特制请求，利用路径遍历攻击读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 A1Stats 1.6 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、系统文件等），CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已发布 1.6 版本修复此问题，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0561"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32.250","remediation":"升级 A1Stats 至 1.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 a1disp2.cgi、a1disp3.cgi、a1disp4.cgi 中的目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面对上述 CGI 脚本的输入参数进行过滤，禁止包含 \"../\" 等路径穿越字符，并限制 CGI 脚本对文件系统的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0047.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/471691","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2705","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6503","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20833","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0561.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0561.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0561","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0561.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0561.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pwqq-cjfr-9p7q/GHSA-pwqq-cjfr-9p7q.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/a1stats.nasl","https://github.com/thetowsif/nuclei-template-fetcher/blob/a976ca2f195df8cbbe200182ad03f933a578bb92/community-templates/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0561.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0229.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0227","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0227.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0559","title":"Vixie Cron crontab 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Vixie cron 3.0.1 及更早版本中的 crontab 程序存在权限降低失败漏洞。当用户通过 crontab 命令修改计划任务时，若修改操作解析失败，程序未能正确降低特权级别，仍以高权限运行。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过故意触发解析错误使编辑器以提升后的权限被调用，从而获取额外的系统权限。该漏洞影响 Linux/Unix 系统中广泛使用的 Vixie cron 任务调度组件，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0559"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32.003","remediation":"升级 Vixie cron 至 3.0pl1-58 或更高版本（Debian 对应 DSA-054 安全更新）。如无法立即升级，限制本地用户对 crontab 命令的访问权限，仅允许受信任用户使用，并监控 /var/spool/cron 目录的异常修改行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-054","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-050.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_017_cron_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/183029","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2687","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6508","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20823","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0559.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0559.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0559","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0559.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0559.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-054.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xxwc-wcp3-hfp4/GHSA-xxwc-wcp3-hfp4.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_200_300.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-054.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0227.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0224","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0224.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0558","title":"T. Hauck Jana Server MS-DOS 设备名拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0558漏洞影响T. Hauck Jana Server 1.45/1.46/2.0及更高版本的Web服务器，该服务器在处理HTTP请求时对MS-DOS设备名称（如aux/prn等）进行不安全的检查。当攻击者向目标服务器发送包含MS-DOS设备名（例如GET /aux HTTP/1.0）的URL请求时，服务器会导致请求处理堆栈异常进而崩溃或停止服务，实现远程拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞是一种基于原始网络输入的内存访问控制缺陷，攻击者无需身份验证即可通过简单的HTTP请求触发。当服务器启动时，对于/MS-DOS风格的设备名称，服务器并未正确处理它们，导致系统资源耗尽或服务不可用。该漏洞影响Windows平台下的Jana Web服务器，攻击可能导致服务器完全不可用，影响企业业务连续性和网络服务稳定性。攻击者可以轻松利用这种简单的请求就能达到破坏服务的效果，攻击方式极其简单直接，迫使管理员紧急采取服务中断等措施应对，极大的影响了系统的可用性。因此，这是一个低复杂度、可直接远程利用的拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者无需任何权限或特殊工具，只需构造一个包含MS-DOS设备名的简单HTTP请求，即可使受害服务器崩溃或停止响应，完全暴露了该Web服务器对URL路径进行不安全检查的安全缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0558"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31.887","remediation":"升级到 Jana Server 2.01 正式版或更高版本，该版本已修复 MS-DOS 设备名称请求导致的崩溃问题。如暂无法升级，应在防火墙或反向代理层过滤包含 MS-DOS 设备名称（CON、AUX、PRN、COM1、LPT1 等）的 HTTP 请求路径，或暂时关闭 Jana Server 面向公网的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0086.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1817","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2704","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6521","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20830","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0558.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0558","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0558.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0558.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x8w9-p5vr-g9q8/GHSA-x8w9-p5vr-g9q8.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/http_w98_devname_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0558.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0224.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0224.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0224.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0222","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0557","title":"T. Hauck Jana Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"T. Hauck Jana Server 1.46 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 Web 服务器发送经过十六进制编码的 \"..\"（即 %2e%2e）序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制，读取服务器文件系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Jana Server 1.46 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者利用此漏洞可获取系统敏感信息，为后续攻击提供铺垫。目前已有公开的 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0557"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31.777","remediation":"立即升级 T. Hauck Jana Server 至 1.46 以上版本，该版本已修复 URL 编码的目录遍历问题。如无法升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层添加规则，对请求路径中的 `%2e%2e`、`%2e/` 等编码后的路径穿越序列进行解码拦截。若产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache 或 Nginx 等活跃维护的 Web 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0086.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/132099","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2703","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6513","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20829","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0557.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0557.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0557","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0557.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0557.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-982w-46v4-62v7/GHSA-982w-46v4-62v7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0557.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2703/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e97a209f-6f0d-48d3-aba5-f6aae086c19f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0220","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0220.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0555","title":"ScreamingMedia SITEWare 目录遍历漏洞","description":"ScreamingMedia SITEWare 2.5 至 3.1 版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在 SITEWare Editor's Desktop 或 SWEditServlet 的 template 参数中构造 `../` 序列进行路径穿越，可读取服务器上任意可读文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0555"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31.523","remediation":"立即升级 ScreamingMedia SITEWare 至 3.1 以上版本（厂商已发布补丁 sms1001.php）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面限制对 SWEditServlet 和 Editor's Desktop 的访问（如通过 .htaccess 或防火墙仅允许可信 IP），并对 template 参数进行严格的路径过滤，拒绝包含 \"../\" 或空字节的请求。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的 Web 内容管理平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0165.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0166.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/795707","http://www.osvdb.org/13887","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2869","http://www01.screamingmedia.com/en/security/sms1001.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6689","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20925","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0555.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0555","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0555.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0555.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mwp3-rx54-m69v/GHSA-mwp3-rx54-m69v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0555.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7b1d9ff0-bf43-4697-a29e-0f9eb487c068.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/04a9a8381d346b006d2615d73d55f4e286759f63/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0220.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0219","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0219.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0554","title":"多厂商 TelnetD 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"多个 BSD 基础的操作系统中的 Telnet 守护程序 (Telnet Daemon, telnetd) 存在严重缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过发送特制选项（包括 AYT（Are You There）命令）触发 telrcv 函数的未验证输入导致内存缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。受影响的操作系统包括 Solaris 2.x/7.0/8、IRIX 6.5.x、OpenBSD 2.x、NetBSD 1.x、Debian 3 和 HP-UX 10，所有版本均存在该漏洞。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用此漏洞，CVSS 评分高达 10.0（CVSS：AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），对系统的保密性、完整性和可用性构成完全破坏。该漏洞源于 TelnetD 在处理协议选项时缺乏长度检查，攻击者可通过精心构造的网络包触发缓冲区溢出。操作系统厂商已发布安全补丁，建议用户升级到最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0554"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31.283","remediation":"建议立即禁用 telnet 服务并改用 SSH 协议（如 OpenSSH 3.4+），在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 23 端口；若必须保留 telnet，请升级至各厂商修复版本：Solaris 8 安装补丁 108968-18、108993-18；OpenBSD 升级至 3.0+；NetBSD 升级至 1.5.2+；Debian 3.0 安装 telnetd_0.17-14.1 补丁包（DSA-070）；HP-UX 10.20 安装 PHNE_22621；IRIX 6.5.x 安装补丁 3521；Gentoo 执行 emerge --update net-misc/netkit-telnetd（GLSA-200410-03）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2001-q4/0014.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000413","http://ftp.support.compaq.com/patches/.new/html/SSRT0745U.shtml","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3476","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/199496","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/199541","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/203000","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-030.0.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-21.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-131.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/catos-telrcv-vuln-pub.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-070","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-075","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-068.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_029_nkitb_txt.html","http://www.osvdb.org/809","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-099.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-100.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/197804","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3064","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6875","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21018","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0554.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0554.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0554","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0554.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-cxg3-hwc8-9mx4/GHSA-cxg3-hwc8-9mx4.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-070.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0554.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/e7a1e0098ca50c8dc77455488033ca407ec81282/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/gentoo-mirror/gentoo/blob/817cbe7010b981e669b9f2f89a6c7614bbc842ae/metadata/glsa/glsa-200410-03.xml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2004/CVE-2004-0911.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0219.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0218","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0218.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0553","title":"SSH Secure Shell 3.0 sshd2 短密码认证绕过漏洞","description":"SSH Secure Shell 3.0.0 在 Unix 系统上对 sshd2 守护进程的密码认证机制存在缺陷，未正确处理短密码字段账户（如使用 \"NP\" 标记锁定的账户），导致本地用户可绕过认证直接访问这些受限账户。该漏洞影响运行 SSH Secure Shell 3.0.0 的 Unix 系统，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用短密码字段缺陷即可获取锁定账户的完全访问权限，CVSS 7.2 分（本地访问、低复杂度、无需认证、完全破坏 CIA 三要素），属高危本地提权漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0553"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31.160","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSH 到 7.9 或更高版本（例如 8.9 及更高主版本），并确保使用最新的安全补丁支持现代密码格式和安全验证机制。修改 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 启用 \"PasswordAuthentication yes\"和 \"PubkeyAuthentication yes\" 并添加 \"PermitRootLogin no\" 和 \"MaxAuthTries 3\"。配置禁止空密码并强制使用复杂的密码策略，建议每次安全事件后更换所有用户密码，并立即禁用所有旧版 SSH 服务（特别是原生支持的任何基于 SSH2 3.0 的服务），这些服务无法升级或将在支持结束后关闭。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0486.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-121.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/737451","http://www.osvdb.org/586","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3078","http://www.ssh.com/products/ssh/exploit.cfm","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6868","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21021","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0553.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0553","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0553.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0553.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4jrf-5jjq-9v28/GHSA-4jrf-5jjq-9v28.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/ssh3_passwd.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0553.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0218.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0212","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0212.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0548","title":"Sun Solaris DTMail 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.6 及 7.0 系统中的 dtmail 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 dtmail 在处理 MAIL 环境变量时未对输入长度进行有效边界检查，本地攻击者可通过设置超长 MAIL 环境变量触发栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址或函数指针，从而劫持程序执行流程。成功利用此漏洞可使攻击者以 dtmail 进程权限（通常为 root 或 mail 用户权限）执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需拥有本地系统账户并具备 shell 访问权限即可发起攻击，无需用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0548"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:30.517","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止维护的 Solaris 2.6 和 Solaris 7，官方已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到受支持的 Solaris 11 或更高版本；若无法升级，可临时移除 dtmail 的 setuid 权限（`chmod 555 /usr/dt/bin/dtmail`）以阻断本地提权，同时限制非授权用户对 dtmail 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99598918914068&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3081","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6879","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21024","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0548.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0548.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0548","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0548.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0548.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0f14531dae9947fef349fa696ac83d6fc56f601e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h5ww-48rq-646f/GHSA-h5ww-48rq-646f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0548.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0212.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0211","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0211.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0538","title":"Microsoft Outlook ActiveX 控件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 2002 及更早版本中的 Outlook View ActiveX 控件存在远程代码执行漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的恶意 HTML 电子邮件或诱导用户访问包含恶意代码的网页来触发该漏洞，在用户打开邮件或预览邮件内容时自动执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Outlook 98/2000/2002 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击无需身份认证且复杂度低，可完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0538"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:29.353","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2001 年 8 月发布的 Outlook 安全更新 (MS01-038)，该更新为 Outlook 2002 及更早版本添加了 Email Security Update，限制 ActiveX 控件在电子邮件中的自动执行。如无法安装补丁，可配置 Outlook 安全设置将「在 HTML 邮件中运行 ActiveX 控件」选项禁用，或使用 Outlook 2003 及以上版本替代。同时建议在邮件网关层面过滤包含 ActiveX 控件的 HTML 邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99496431214078&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-113.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/131569","http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0107&L=ntbugtraq&F=P&S=&P=862","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3025","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-038","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6831","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21003","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0538.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0538.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0538","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0538.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef