um/dcfNews/167.html","http://www.osvdb.org/480","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2728","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6538","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20849","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0527.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0527.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0527","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0527.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0527.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2dd0160b9ec0105216522022a89e49e69be74f7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rr68-4frw-wr7p/GHSA-rr68-4frw-wr7p.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_800_900.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-140.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0207","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0207.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0526","title":"Sun Solaris mailtool 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 8 及更早版本中 mailtool 所调用的 Xview 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 OPENWINHOME 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而以 mailtool 进程权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 8 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地账户才能利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0526"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:28.087","remediation":"立即安装 Sun 官方补丁 108434-03 或更高版本（适用于 Solaris 8），该补丁修复了 Xview 库在处理 OPENWINHOME 环境变量时的缓冲区溢出问题。对于 Solaris 7 及更早版本，请安装对应补丁 108435-03。如无法立即打补丁，可通过限制本地用户登录、移除 mailtool 的 setuid 权限作为临时缓解措施。由于 Solaris 8 已停止支持，建议迁移至 Solaris 11 或受支持的替代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0258.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6626","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20885","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0526.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0526","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0526.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0526.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d99b1b66d0cac20b8bc92baa53c2887e8bf76b6d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7qc5-86ww-mrvw/GHSA-7qc5-86ww-mrvw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0526.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0207.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0206","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0522","title":"GNU GnuPG 1.0.x 格式字符串漏洞","description":"GnuPG (Gnu Privacy Guard) 1.05 及更早版本存在格式化字符串漏洞，源于程序在处理加密文件中存储的原始文件名时，未对格式化字符串进行正确验证。攻击者可构造包含恶意格式化字符串（如 %n、%s 等格式说明符）的文件名，将其加密后诱导受害者解密，解密过程中格式化字符串被作为格式参数处理，导致栈内存被任意读写，进而实现任意代码执行或提权。该漏洞影响 GnuPG 1.05 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属高危漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，只需诱导用户解密恶意加密文件即可触发漏洞，攻击成功可导致系统完全被攻破。Debian 等发行版已发布安全公告 DSA-061 提供修复补丁，建议升级至 GnuPG 1.06 或更高版本修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0522"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:27.560","remediation":"建议立即升级 GnuPG 到 1.0.6 或更高版本（1.0.6 版本已修复此格式字符串漏洞）。通过包管理器更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install gnupg`，RedHat/CentOS 执行 `yum update gnupg`，或从官网 https://gnupg.org/download/ 下载最新版本编译安装。若暂时无法升级，请避免处理来源不可信的加密文件，并在防火墙层面限制非必要的网络服务暴露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000399","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-023-01","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/188218","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-020.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-061","http://www.gnupg.org/whatsnew.html#rn20010529","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/403051","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-053.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_020_gpg_txt.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1845","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-073.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2797","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2001-June/000439.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6642","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20889","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0522.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0522","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0522.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0522.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-59h7-cqx3-mx33/GHSA-59h7-cqx3-mx33.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-061.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-061.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--074a9c77-eebe-436c-8c4c-7bd43da86fd3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0205","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0205.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0521","title":"Aladdin eSafe Gateway 3.0 Unicode 脚本过滤绕过漏洞","description":"Aladdin eSafe Gateway 3.0 及更早版本存在 Unicode 编码绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过将 HTML 文档中的 SCRIPT 标签进行 Unicode 编码，绕过网关的 HTML 脚本过滤机制。成功利用该漏洞可导致跨站脚本攻击（XSS），造成敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或恶意脚本执行。攻击无需认证，仅需诱使用户访问特制网页即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0521"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:27.450","remediation":"升级到 Aladdin eSafe Gateway 3.0 以上版本（如 3.1 或更高），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至现代 Web 安全网关产品（如 Fortinet FortiWeb、F5 BIG-IP ASM 等），并在迁移前在网络层部署 WAF 规则对 Unicode 编码的 `<SCRIPT>` 标签进行规范化检测和拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0285.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6580","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20891","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0521.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0521","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0521.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0521.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pgcc-58m2-q23c/GHSA-pgcc-58m2-q23c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88862/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0521.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2a82b635-2546-405f-8605-655a65020384.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0205.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0205.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0205.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0204","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0204.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0520","title":"Aladdin eSafe Gateway 脚本过滤绕过漏洞","description":"Aladdin eSafe Gateway 3.0 及更早版本存在脚本过滤绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过将恶意 SCRIPT 代码嵌入特定 HTML 标签属性中（如 BODY 标签的 onload 属性、A 标签的 href 属性、BUTTON 标签、INPUT 标签以及其他支持脚本定义的 HTML 标签），绕过网关的安全过滤机制，在目标用户浏览器中执行任意脚本代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或进一步攻击。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0520"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:27.347","remediation":"升级 Aladdin eSafe Gateway 至 3.0 以上版本（厂商已发布修复版本）。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 Web 安全网关产品。如无法立即升级，可在网关上启用更严格的 HTTP 内容过滤规则，对包含 onload、onclick、onerror 等事件处理器的 HTML 标签进行深度检测和拦截，并禁用不必要的 HTML 标签白名单外的所有标签。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0284.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6580","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20869","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0520.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0520","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0520.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0520.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jv87-5579-838c/GHSA-jv87-5579-838c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88824/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0520.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/lardianos/Security/blob/611d68cad16afa3eb18254e639badc38b2f85777/CWE_83/tex/chapters/intro/intro.tex"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0204.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0204.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0204.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0203","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0203.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0519","title":"Aladdin eSafe Gateway HTML标签脚本过滤绕过漏洞","description":"Aladdin eSafe Gateway 2.x 版本存在 HTML 脚本过滤绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过将 SCRIPT 标签嵌套嵌入其他 SCRIPT 标签内的特殊 HTML 标签排列方式，绕过网关的 HTML SCRIPT 过滤机制，导致恶意脚本代码被传递至目标用户浏览器执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，成功利用后可窃取用户会话 Cookie、篡改网页内容或发起钓鱼攻击，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞影响 Aladdin eSafe Gateway 2.x 及 3.0 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0519"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:27.230","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，建议立即升级至受支持的 Web 安全网关产品。如暂时无法替换，可在 eSafe Gateway 管理控制台中启用深度内容检测（Deep Content Inspection）功能，并在上游防火墙或反向代理层部署额外的 Web 应用过滤规则，拦截嵌套的 `<SCRIPT>` 标签模式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0282.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6580","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20890","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0519.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0519","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0519.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0519.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7c78b01f402841eaeb570a26d276cd67a60a9531/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3pqf-w3gx-274j/GHSA-3pqf-w3gx-274j.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88850/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0519.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d0ab60e6-fb4c-4056-99a5-1cfbf5174b3d.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/864adb9ddf294417a5a4e84f90f9adf54e9dca89/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0203.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0203.toml"}]